  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3803.02 Registration",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-08-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3803.02 Registration. The owner or operator of a source who wishes to register VER shall contact The Climate Registry, whether by mail at 523 W. 6th Street, Suite 445, Los Angeles, CA 90014, by telephone at 866-523-0764, or by fax at 213-627-7727, to obtain information relative to registering VER with The Climate Registry, including but not limited to requirements for measuring, verifying, documenting, and transferring VER.\n\nSource. #7456, eff 2-24-01; ss by #9393, INTERIM, eff 2-24-09, EXPIRES: 8-24-09; ss by #9470, eff 5-16-09 (from Env-A 3804.02)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3800.html"
